                                        "entry_id": "52f4e2a8-3dc4-36cd-af4a-73783ad7aaf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Proceeding from one step to the next in sequence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7b765d2-47ca-4181-9c90-cf01b0b37343",
                                                "sense_id": "381aacaf-3c90-315d-b6dd-1c0b477e3876",
                                                "text": "The step-by-step directions walked me through the assembly, but identifying the parts was still hard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1d1ae28-20b5-49fc-a1e7-5632756b7eaf",
                                                "sense_id": "381aacaf-3c90-315d-b6dd-1c0b477e3876",
                                                "text": "Purchasing TON through a CEX is a straightforward process. As of June 2024, TON isn’t supported on other prominent exchanges such as Coinbase, Binance and Kraken. Here is a step-by-step guide on how to buy Toncoin using an example of Gate.io: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
